# Development Cases
This directory will contain the 30 development cases for AOA-Bench.

---

## 📌 Purpose
Development cases are used to:
1. Tune AOA’s semantic and deterministic components.
2. Iterate on claim extraction, evidence checking, and defect detection.
3. Validate changes before running on the holdout set.

---

## 📁 Structure
Organize cases into subdirectories by category:

```
benchmark/dev/
├── arithmetic/
│   ├── case-001.json
│   ├── case-002.json
│   └── ...
├── facts/
│   ├── case-001.json
│   └── ...
├── citations/
│   ├── case-001.json
│   └── ...
├── contradictions/
│   ├── case-001.json
│   └── ...
├── judgment/
│   ├── case-001.json
│   └── ...
└── clean/
    ├── case-001.json
    └── ...
```

---

## 📝 Case Naming Convention
- Use the format: `case-[ID].json` (e.g., `case-001.json`).
- Assign IDs sequentially (e.g., `AOA-DEV-001`, `AOA-DEV-002`).

---

## 🚀 Next Steps
1. Populate this directory with 30 development cases.
2. Ensure cases cover all categories and defect types.
3. Validate cases against the [AOA-Bench Taxonomy](../taxonomy.md).

